      "type": "text",
      "x": 32,
      "y": 96,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 63,
      "text": "Clean Architecture, dependencies inward: Presentation → Application → Domain → Infrastructure (AGENTS.md §2.2)\nA file under domain/ or use-cases/ may not import @nestjs/*, Prisma, BullMQ, any UI library, or any vendor SDK.\nSources: AGENTS.md §2.1–§2.15 · ADR-002 · ADR-003 · ADR-004 · ADR-013 · ADR-015",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5b6270",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "el_000003"
